Subject: [PATCH 187/235] perf(timing): fix C6 dispatch-overhead proxy and add
 GPU preflight sampling

- dispatch_overhead now receives the TimingProxy explicitly (r1 recorded
  AttributeError: 'CudaRuntime' object has no attribute 'collect').
- five-sample nvidia-smi preflight window check with an optional
  --preflight-max-utilization-pct abort, so a busy shared GamePC does not
  silently produce a round that is later voided.
- measured kernel ordering fix is already in the first commit (one real
  launch before the closed-form correctness read).
